  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While hunting a method to delay aperture calamities and tribulations, Fang Yuan also records years pass like months beside this immortal killer move. Faster aperture time brings calamities and tribulations sooner in outside-world time and also speeds resource growth and cultivation progress. Immortal day Gu or month Gu would cut the mortal day Gu and month Gu cost and raise the effect.",
