    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan activates years pass like days; the tributary of the River of Time in the sovereign immortal aperture expands and its water flows faster, raising an already high aperture rate further. Calamities and tribulations come more rapidly, while resource output rises with them, especially dragonfish in dragon scale sea area.",
